' DEEPWARDEN
' An original game by Claude (an AI made by Anthropic) for Amy Studio,
' 2026, in Amy by Amy Bienvenu: a first-person dungeon crawler.
'
' The bell beneath Hollowmere rings by itself, and monsters climb out of
' the old mines. You are the town's last warden: go down three floors,
' find the keys, the pick and the hidden ways, and silence the Bell-
' Ringer's Servant in the bell chamber at the bottom.
'
' Controls. Standard controller: the stick walks and turns, pulling back
' guards; left fire swings, right fire is the lantern flare; keypad *
' the hero sheet, # the map, 1 a potion. Super Action Controller: yellow
' swings, orange flares, purple drinks, blue the map, the speed roller
' turns (the stick works too).
'
' How it is drawn: STORM LIGHT's ray caster (gen.py, ray_src.asm ->
' ray.asm) with rock, timber, cracked rock and gate textures and wall
' pictures; monsters are magnified sprites in 4 drawn sizes, cut column
' by column where a wall is nearer (StMon); the weapon is one sprite a
' line over them. Wall cells with a state ("slots": chests, gates,
' secrets...) open and close through SlotOpen.

cartridge "DEEPWARDEN/CLAUDE/2026"

